{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:09.78]Time don't ride when it's around on me (Okay)\n[Chorus]\n[00:16.74]Her eyes shine like the diamonds on my wrist-watch (Bling)\n[00:19.58]Keep giving good love to me baby, don't stop (Uh, uh, please)\n[00:22.84]Keep giving good drugs to me baby, don't stop (Uh, uh, please)\n[00:26.34]Perky 'til my jaw lock, lean 'til my heart stops (Uh, uh, oh)\n[00:28.98]Taking pills 'til I see dead people, like a séance (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:32.72]Look into my pocket, dead people, Ben Franklin (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:35.72]She told me she gon' ride me like a bike, Tour dé France (Yeah, yeah), ooh\n[00:39.50]Do it, no hands, AP watch on both hands (Yeah, yeah)\n[Post-Chorus]\n[00:41.18](AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[00:42.10]Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[00:53.20]Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:56.06]Ch'yeah, watch it glisten, watch it shine\n[00:58.36]I been shittin' on these bitches, and these niggas, I'm in my prime (Uh-huh)\n[01:01.80]Time is money, I got Benjamin Franklin clocks on the wall (Yeah)\n[01:04.94]Big ass Glocks on the wall, .30 clip by my balls (Huh, ch'yeah)\n[01:09.04]New AP, that's a Chandelier-lier-lier-lier\n[01:11.94]Let the choppa sing, sound like Britney Spear-ear-ear-ears (Grahh, grahh)\n[01:15.50]Unbuckle the Gucci belt, dropped the Balenciaga trousers, I'm finna shit on my peers (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[01:19.18]I'm shooting like Rubio, I got a hundred thousand dollars singing in my right ear, yee-haw\n[01:23.42]In my right ear, rich ass cowboy here\n[01:26.08]Buzz like a nigga, Lightyear\n[01:27.70]Take off in a 'Rari like Top Gear, off Percs I steer (Skrrt)\n[01:30.76]Eating too good with no reservations\n[01:32.56]Presidential status, like I'm Ronald Reagan, let's go\n[Chorus]\n[01:34.64]Her eyes shine like the diamonds on my wrist-watch (Bling)\n[01:38.06]Keep giving good love to me baby, don't stop (Uh, uh, please)\n[01:41.64]Keep giving good drugs to me baby, don't stop (Uh, uh, please)\n[01:44.80]Perky 'til my jaw lock, lean 'til my heart stops (Uh, uh, oh)\n[01:47.92]Taking pills 'til I see dead people, like a séance (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:51.22]Look into my pocket, dead people, Ben Franklin (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:54.24]She told me she gon' ride me like a bike, Tour dé France (Yeah, yeah), ooh\n[01:55.82]Do it, no hands, AP watch on both hands (Yeah, yeah)\n[Post-Chorus]\n[01:56.98]Bih-bih, ooh, what, ooh, bih, yeah, huh (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[01:58.66]Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[02:03.26]Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[02:14.44]Gleam\n[Verse 2]\n[02:14.62]AP on my watch nigga don't tick (Nigga don't tick, uh)\n[02:17.24]Go, James Bond with the golden eye, nigga one shot, don’t miss (Uh-huh, let's go)\n[02:20.64]All I know is cash, ball out I swish (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[02:23.88]Disrespect all the opp niggas, all in graves, rest in piss (Fuck 'em)\n[02:27.16]Pull up on the scene (Yeah), looking like a new guy, every single day (Yeah)\n[02:29.88]All I know is ball out, LeBron James (Yeah)\n[02:31.50]Shoot a shot, hit 'em with a fade away (Yeah)\n[02:33.18]In the cut, snip, no scissors nigga, I'ma cut him like a razor blade (Yeah)\n[02:36.50]Pourin' codeine in the Minute Maid (Yeah)\n[02:38.16]I'm a real nigga, niggas been afraid of me (Yeah, brrt)\n[02:40.58]Shit get ugly, ball like Jordan, you play Rugby (Uh-uh, uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[02:43.58]I feel safe with my strap on my left\n[02:44.48]You feel safe when you cuddled up inside a snuggie\n[02:46.16]I don't do buddy buddy, your bitch want a hubby\n[02:47.78]Actually, she admitted that she wanna fuck me (Woah)\n[02:49.58]Got a wife, I won't do it, just thought it was funny (Uh)\n[02:51.00]That shit sting like a bee, I thought she was your honey, damn (Let's go)\n[02:53.72]Bitch, I'm on fire, you can't put me out, I won't extinguish at all (Yeah)\n[02:55.92]It feel like I got Velcro all over my body (Yeah, huh)\n[02:57.62]This money stick to me like I'm on a wall (Yeah)\n[02:59.28]I sip codeine like I'm sippin' on alcohol (Yeah)\n[03:00.82]Used to stand on the block, I feel like Pau Gasol (Yeah, uh-huh)\n[03:02.56]Got my hand on my Glock, other hand on a thot (Yeah)\n[03:04.20]That I met up in Barney's, don't go to the mall, let's go\n[Chorus]\n[03:06.38]Her eyes shine like the diamonds on my wrist-watch (Let’s go)\n[03:09.62]Keep giving good love to me baby, don't stop (Ooh, don’t stop)\n[03:12.88]Keep giving good drugs to me baby, don't stop (Ooh, don’t stop)\n[03:16.18]Perky 'til my jaw lock, lean 'til my heart stops (Uh, don’t stop)\n[03:19.44]Taking pills 'til I see dead people, like a séance (Uh-uh)\n[03:22.74]Look into my pocket, dead people, Ben Franklin (Franklin)\n[03:25.96]She told me she gon' ride me like a bike, Tour dé France (France), ooh\n[03:30.28]Do it, no hands, AP watch on both hands\n[Post-Chorus]\n[03:36.22]Bih-bih, ooh, what, ooh, bih, yeah, huh (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[03:48.16]Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)\n[03:51.46]Oh, do it, no hands AP watch on both hands (AP watch on both hands don't tick)","words":[[9.78,10.16,"Time"],[10.2,10.56,"don't"],[10.66,10.98,"ride"],[11.02,11.12,"when"],[11.16,11.24,"it's"],[11.28,11.82,"around"],[11.92,12.12,"on"],[12.24,12.34,"me"],[15.8,16.2,"(Okay)"],[16.74,16.92,"Her"],[16.96,17.02,"eyes"],[17.1,17.5,"shine"],[17.56,17.72,"like"],[17.76,17.82,"the"],[17.96,18.4,"diamonds"],[18.46,18.48,"on"],[18.56,18.64,"my"],[18.72,19.3,"wrist-watch"],[19.36,19.48,"(Bling)"],[19.58,19.88,"Keep"],[20.0,20.34,"giving"],[20.44,20.68,"good"],[20.82,21.14,"love"],[21.2,21.32,"to"],[21.42,21.5,"me"],[21.64,21.88,"baby,"],[22.04,22.32,"don't"],[22.38,22.5,"stop"],[22.54,22.56,"(Uh,"],[22.6,22.62,"uh,"],[22.66,22.8,"please)"],[22.84,23.